From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Goyvaerts <jonathan.goyvaerts@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:28:19 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: media: apple,avd: Add the T6040 and T8132
 decoders

The T6040 (M4 Pro) video decoder is the T8132 (M4) one: its MCU firmware
programs the same register family, so it falls back to
apple,t8132-avd. The driver already matches apple,t8132-avd; document
it as well.

Signed-off-by: Jonathan Goyvaerts <jonathan.goyvaerts@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: LLM
(cherry picked from commit add5317fa2adfe14d29e1eda42adfaeaf0075c54)
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,avd.yaml | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,avd.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,avd.yaml
index a724e982b4..59ccb50461 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,avd.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,avd.yaml
@@ -20,12 +20,16 @@ properties:
               - apple,t6030-avd
               - apple,t6031-avd
           - const: apple,t8122-avd
+      - items:
+          - const: apple,t6041-avd
+          - const: apple,t8132-avd
       - enum:
           - apple,t8103-avd
           - apple,t6000-avd
           - apple,t8112-avd
           - apple,t6020-avd
           - apple,t8122-avd
+          - apple,t8132-avd
           - apple,t8140-avd
 
   reg:
